cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "jaspSyntheticData: A JASP module for generating synthetic data"
abstract: >-
  jaspSyntheticData is a JASP module that generates synthetic versions of a
  dataset using the synthpop R package, giving researchers a point-and-click
  route to sharing data that cannot be released in its original form. The
  module synthesizes the selected variables with CART, conditional trees, or
  parametric models; reports utility measures (pMSE and standardized pMSE) and
  distribution comparison plots so users can judge how closely the synthetic
  data match the original; and exports the synthetic dataset as a CSV file.
